    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>If an elderly person is leaving a long-term home, Chayce helps sort and declutter it room by room, packs what they are keeping and moves it, with their agreement at every step. We are not a house clearance firm: we do not empty a property for disposal. Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}, with declutter support from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
