      <div class="rx-copy">
        <span class="gd-eyebrow" style="text-align:left">Sorting and decluttering</span>
        <h2>Clearing a home <em>with</em> the person, not around them</h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">Clearing a parent&rsquo;s or relative&rsquo;s home is rarely just a job. Decades of belongings carry memories, and decisions are easier when they are made calmly, one room at a time. We help families do this without anyone feeling rushed.</p>
        <ul class="rx-points"><li><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Room by room</h3><p>Everything is sorted into keep, sell, donate and let go, at the person&rsquo;s pace and item by item.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Sentimental items first</h3><p>Photographs, letters and family pieces are set aside to decide on properly, never swept up in a bulk clear-out.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-box-open" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Packed and labelled</h3><p>What is staying with the person is packed by room, with medication and important papers kept accessible.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>An insured removal</h3><p>Moved by DBS-checked staff and insured against loss or damage in transit, with the cover set out in your service agreement.</p></li></ul>
        <p class="rx-where">What is included depends on the package. Declutter support starts with Silver Comfort. Sorting is always done with the owner&rsquo;s agreement, or with the family or attorney where the person cannot decide for themselves.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">What we do and do not do</span><h2>Is it sorting and moving, <em>or skips?</em></h2></div>
    <div class="gd-rows">
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>House-clearance firm</h3><p>Empties a property, usually quickly and for a fee based on volume, for sale, probate or a landlord. Little or no sorting with the owner.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Chayce</h3><p>Helps an older person or their family decide what to keep, sell, donate or let go, then packs and moves what is staying. Nothing goes without agreement. We do not empty a property for disposal.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>If you need both</h3><p>Some families use us for the sorting and the move, then a separate, reputable local clearance firm for whatever is left. We are happy to work around that.</p></div>
    </div>
